  "_clock": "Times are resolved at 24 Sep 2026 12:00 Tallinn time (UTC+03:00, 09:00Z). The prototype computes them from the moment it is opened: each seed time is a local Tallinn wall-clock time n days from today (see _relativeTimes), never later than 20 minutes before now; createdAtUtc of an event is 18 minutes after its happenedAtUtc, never later than 1 minute before now. Timestamps carry an explicit offset.",
  "_photos": "Each photo is stored once, in its case’s photos. insuranceCaseEventId is null for the photos the case was registered with; otherwise the photo belongs to that event. entry names the timeline entry. No image files: the prototype draws placeholders from the file name.",
